── SYNTAX ERROR ────────── E0100_parameter_type_without_a_colon.lt:1:10  [E0100]

Stilt writes a parameter's type after `:`, as `a: i64`:

  1 │ fn add(a i64, b i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │          ^^^

A parameter is its name, `:` and its type.

To fix it, write `:`:

  1 │ fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │         +       +
